WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.900
The issue of passports exchange, it was said
that you (&amp; Zelensky) have a lot in common,

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.920
could you explain what did you mean?

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:11.360
Well, it's simple, if Ukraine will give passports
to Russians

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:16.180
and we in Russia will give passports &amp; citizenship to Ukrainians

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:21.440
then sooner or
later we'll inevitably achieve the expected result,

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.340
everyone will have common citizenship,

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:24.640
we welcome that

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.740
Goodbye (In Ukrainian)

